Let me recall that ∛x is the same as x^(1/3). So, perhaps I can write all the expressions with exponents.

Original expression:

P = [ (6)^(1/3) × ( (1/162) )^(1/3) ]⁻¹

Then, combining exponents:

(6)^(1/3) × (1/162)^(1/3) = [6 × (1/162)]^(1/3)

Which is same as before
